WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:02.450
A tall, bare tree.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.690
Then, slowly, green
vines begin to climb it.

3
00:00:06.740 --> 00:00:12.560
"I think of thee!—my thoughts do twine
and bud" Her thoughts twine round him like

4
00:00:12.610 --> 00:00:14.240
wild vines.

5
00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:18.780
In the last line, she says the
opposite: "I do not think of thee".

6
00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:22.060
A love poem that ends with
her not thinking of him?

7
00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:23.190
Why?

8
00:00:23.240 --> 00:00:27.560
In this mission, you'll follow the vines
and the tree right through the sonnet.

9
00:00:27.610 --> 00:00:29.820
You'll find the word
where the sonnet turns,

10
00:00:29.870 --> 00:00:32.720
early, in line 5: "Yet".

11
00:00:32.770 --> 00:00:35.310
And you'll hear her
give the tree an order:

12
00:00:35.360 --> 00:00:37.200
"Renew thy presence".

13
00:00:37.250 --> 00:00:41.400
Your mission: explain why she
ends by not thinking of him.
